---
/*
 * The colophon: who kept the notebook, and how to reach them.
 *
 * A bound volume ends with its production details rather than a sales pitch,
 * so the contact block is a plain table of facts — the same register as the
 * rest of the record.
 */
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import { logbook } from '@/data/site';
---

<footer id="colophon" class="colophon-block">
  <div class="site-container colophon-inner">
    <div class="colophon-prose">
      <p class="margin-label">
        <span class="lang-en">About the author</span>
        <span class="lang-es">Sobre el autor</span>
      </p>
      <p class="lang-en">
        I design the node, write the firmware, build the backend, wire the dashboard and harden the whole thing.
        No handoffs, no “that’s the other company’s part”. You deal with one person who owns the result — and
        everything in this notebook ships with its own test suite.
      </p>
      <p class="lang-es">
        Diseño el nodo, escribo el firmware, monto el backend, conecto el panel y endurezco el conjunto. Sin
        intermediarios ni «eso es de la otra empresa». Tratas con una sola persona que responde del resultado — y
        todo lo que hay en este cuaderno lleva su propia suite de tests.
      </p>
      <p class="colophon-muted lang-en">
        Available for a role or for commissioned work. Every claim in these {logbook.count} entries has verifiable
        output behind it; the repositories are public and the dates are the repositories’ own.
      </p>
      <p class="colophon-muted lang-es">
        Disponible para un puesto o para trabajo por encargo. Cada afirmación de estas {logbook.count} entradas
        tiene salida verificable detrás; los repositorios son públicos y las fechas son las suyas.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="colophon-contact">
      <p class="margin-label">
        <span class="lang-en">Contact</span>
        <span class="lang-es">Contacto</span>
      </p>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt><span class="lang-en">Email</span><span class="lang-es">Correo</span></dt>
          <dd><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt><span class="lang-en">Repositories</span><span class="lang-es">Repositorios</span></dt>
          <dd>
            <a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/Zoel-Manchon <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt><span class="lang-en">Location</span><span class="lang-es">Ubicación</span></dt>
          <dd><span class="lang-en">{site.location.en}</span><span class="lang-es">{site.location.es}</span></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt><span class="lang-en">This volume</span><span class="lang-es">Este volumen</span></dt>
          <dd>
            <span class="lang-en">Built with Astro · back to <a href="#top">the top</a></span>
            <span class="lang-es">Hecho con Astro · volver <a href="#top">arriba</a></span>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
